OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows' new team leader takes
OL,4,Athe controls
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe new team leader of the RAF's Red
OL,7,FArrows aerobatic display team has
OL,8,Fdescribed his appointment as a
OL,9,F"tremendous honour".
OL,11,FSquadron Leader James Turner, a former
OL,12,Ffrontline Typhoon pilot, has taken up
OL,13,Fthe role of Red 1, succeeding Wing
OL,14,FCommander Jon Bond.
OL,16,FHe returns to the aerobatic team after
OL,17,Fpreviously flying with the Reds between
OL,18,F2020 and 2023.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
