OL,3,GNEWSARed Arrows' new team leader takes
OL,4,Athe controls
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs Red 1, he will oversee the Red
OL,7,FArrows' annual display programme, from
OL,8,Fdesigning the aerobatic routine and
OL,9,Fleading training to commanding the team
OL,10,Fin the air.
